<title>UK: London coal/ore fixtures.</title>
<headline>London coal/ore fixtures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>COAL - Carbunesti - 150,000 tonnes coal Richards Bay/Rotterdam $7 fio scale load/25,000 shinc mid April Cobelfret.</p>
<p>SG China - 150,000 tonnes coal Banjermasin/Rotterdam $8.75 fio 15,000 shinc/40,000 shinc 15-30/4 PT Adaro.</p>
<p>OBO TBN - 70,000 tonnes coal Hampton Roads/Ijmuiden approx. $7 fio five days shinc March-April Hoogovens.</p>
<p>TBN - 120,000 tonnes coal Queensland/Kaohsiung $5.90 fio 40,000/28,000 option New South Wales at $6.50 35,000 load 13-23/4 China Steel.</p>
</text>
